        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "壬子癸龙脉，丙丁方合望，向前如走马步去，若再能遮挡东方木气，可见阳龙清灵更甚。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
