        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "壬子龙脉要挨左边出癸水，向要朝向子边推算；子水不拘从左右合局，家富斗量金。",
        "confidence": "high",
